{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type WithoutVirtualProps<T> = T extends unknown ? Omit<T, keyof VirtualRowProps> : never;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/virtual-props.ts#L175","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/virtual-props.ts:175"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extracts the base type from a type that may have virtual properties.\nUseful when you need to work with the raw data without virtual properties."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type that may include virtual properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type UserWithVirtual = { id: string; name: string; $hasPendingWrites: boolean; $origin: 'local' | 'remote' }\ntype User = WithoutVirtualProps<UserWithVirtual>\n// { id: string; name: string }","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype WithoutVirtualProps<T> = T extends unknown ? Omit<T, keyof VirtualRowProps> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/virtual-props.ts:175](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/virtual-props.ts#L175)\n\nExtracts the base type from a type that may have virtual properties.\nUseful when you need to work with the raw data without virtual properties.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type that may include virtual properties\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\ntype UserWithVirtual = { id: string; name: string; $hasPendingWrites: boolean; $origin: 'local' | 'remote' }\ntype User = WithoutVirtualProps<UserWithVirtual>\n// { id: string; name: string }\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: WithoutVirtualProps\ntitle: WithoutVirtualProps\n---\n\n```ts\ntype WithoutVirtualProps<T> = T extends unknown ? Omit<T, keyof VirtualRowProps> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/virtual-props.ts:175](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/virtual-props.ts#L175)\n\nExtracts the base type from a type that may have virtual properties.\nUseful when you need to work with the raw data without virtual properties.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type that may include virtual properties\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\ntype UserWithVirtual = { id: string; name: string; $hasPendingWrites: boolean; $origin: 'local' | 'remote' }\ntype User = WithoutVirtualProps<UserWithVirtual>\n// { id: string; name: string }\n```\n"}
